# Quest for Ancient Secrets: "from anywhere" includes the battlefield. Mishra's Bauble, sacrificed as a cost, is put into
# Bot1's graveyard from the battlefield: one counter. Casting Bauble (it enters the battlefield, from the stack) and
# casting Quest itself are no cards put into a graveyard, and Quest is not on the battlefield to see itself arrive: one
# counter in all.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Quest for Ancient Secrets
Mishra's Bauble
Island x4
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain x21

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Quest for Ancient Secrets.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mishra's Bauble.Cast
Bot1.Pass
! Bot1.Accept
Bot1.Battlefield.Mishra's Bauble.Activate(Bot2)
Bot1.Accept
[Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = Mishra's Bauble
Bot1.Battlefield.Quest for Ancient Secrets.Counters.Quest = 1
